WEBVTT

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:18.126
(ALL SINGING ALONG)

00:00:25.884 --> 00:00:27.552
(CHEERING)

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.763
What about that, huh?

00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:32.515
Give it up for Johnny, folks!

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:33.808
(LOUD CHEERING)

00:00:45.486 --> 00:00:47.739
What's with the face? You were great!

00:00:47.822 --> 00:00:48.865
They loved you!

00:00:50.742 --> 00:00:52.493
Yeah, thanks, Rosita.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.125
(INDISTINCT TALKING
OVER POLICE MEGAPHONE)

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.466
BUSTER: All right.
Welcome to all you newcomers!

00:01:06.591 --> 00:01:09.052
You are just in time to meet a teenager

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.429
who was recently dumped by her boyfriend.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:12.764
(AUDIENCE MOANS)

00:01:12.889 --> 00:01:13.973
I know, right?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.977
But she's gonna chase those blues away
with a song of her very own.

00:01:18.061 --> 00:01:21.147
Allow me to introduce the singing sensation...

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:22.231
Ash!

00:01:22.607 --> 00:01:24.067
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.368
(STRUMS GUITAR LOUDLY)

00:01:36.537 --> 00:01:37.705
(GUITAR TURNS OFF)

00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:39.832
Judith?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.752
You are all trespassing on private property.

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.087
-What?
-And you will leave right now.

00:01:44.253 --> 00:01:45.755
No, no, no. Judith...

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:46.839
All of you!

00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:48.216
(ALL GROAN)

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:50.885
(RHYTHMIC STOMPING)

00:01:56.641 --> 00:01:58.017
(RHYTHMIC CLAPPING)

00:02:03.147 --> 00:02:06.609
(SINGING ROCK SONG)

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.629
I am calling the police.

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.339
(ASH CONTINUES SINGING)

00:02:52.947 --> 00:02:56.993
Ugh. Seriously? She's not even that good.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.704
(SCOFFS) Yeah, yeah. Totally.

00:02:59.787 --> 00:03:00.955
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:03:02.957 --> 00:03:05.918
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:03:20.725 --> 00:03:22.393
(ALL GASP)

00:03:32.028 --> 00:03:34.405
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:03:56.677 --> 00:03:58.262
Uh...

00:03:58.346 --> 00:04:00.098
You guys okay?

00:04:00.181 --> 00:04:01.390
(CHEERING)

00:04:05.269 --> 00:04:07.105
Ash! Ash! Ash!

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.317
What about that? (LAUGHS)

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.321
We just witnessed the birth
of a genuine rock star!

00:04:15.404 --> 00:04:17.782
Moon, you've got some stuck here.

00:04:17.865 --> 00:04:18.866
Ow!

00:04:19.075 --> 00:04:20.201
(PANTING)

00:04:30.044 --> 00:04:31.546
BUSTER: He may be tiny,

00:04:31.671 --> 00:04:34.006
but there's no denying his enormous talent.

00:04:34.382 --> 00:04:37.552
Would you please welcome to the stage, Mike!

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:39.303
What are you doing back here?

00:04:39.554 --> 00:04:40.555
Relax, sweetheart.

00:04:40.638 --> 00:04:43.349
Just came back
to show you bozos how it's really done.

00:04:43.432 --> 00:04:44.976
Now, watch this.

00:04:50.148 --> 00:04:56.028
(SINGING TRADITIONAL POP SONG)

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:16.424
(SPITS)

00:05:16.507 --> 00:05:17.884
Boss! That is him!

00:05:18.092 --> 00:05:19.343
That is Mike!

00:05:20.511 --> 00:05:22.013
(GROWLS)

00:05:59.967 --> 00:06:01.802
I'm so proud of you.

00:06:01.886 --> 00:06:05.556
(MIKE CONTINUES SINGING)

00:06:12.855 --> 00:06:13.856
Uh-oh.

00:06:15.483 --> 00:06:18.277
(SONG CONTINUES)

00:06:18.361 --> 00:06:20.363
(WIND WHOOSHING)

00:06:22.949 --> 00:06:24.200
You gotta be kidding me.

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:25.284
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:06:25.409 --> 00:06:26.410
(GRUNTS)

